aced at 4 stations and one wind sensor was recalibrated. Re"},{"marker":"c3","chunk_id":"00000000-0000-4000-a000-000000011013","item_id":"00000000-0000-4000-a000-000000000101","item_title":"45-ISEA Summer Field Log (Sample)","page_no":3,"quote":"Snow and sea-ice observations. The team dug 12 snow pits and recorded density every 10 cm. Fast ice near the landing site was observed to break up in the final week of the campaign"}]'::jsonb, 'inside-a-sample-antarctic-field-log', 'published', '2026-02-10T10:00:00.000Z', '2026-02-10T10:00:00.000Z', '2026-02-09T10:00:00.000Z') on conflict do nothing;
